<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to ShopEase</title>

    <style>
            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            body {
                background: #f4f6fb;
                font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
                color: #444;
                padding: 40px 15px;
            }

            .container {
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: auto;
                background: #ffffff;
                border-radius: 18px;
                overflow: hidden;
                box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
            }

            .header {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg,#534AB7,#6C63FF);
                padding: 45px 30px;
                text-align: center;
            }

                .header h1 {
                    color: #fff;
                    font-size: 32px;
                    margin-bottom: 10px;
                }

                .header p {
                    color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
                    font-size: 16px;
                }

            .content {
                padding: 40px;
            }

                .content h2 {
                    color: #222;
                    margin-bottom: 20px;
                    font-size: 24px;
                }

                .content p {
                    line-height: 1.8;
                    margin-bottom: 18px;
                    color: #555;
                    font-size: 15px;
                }

            .credentials {
                background: #f7f8fc;
                border: 1px solid #e5e7f2;
                border-radius: 12px;
                padding: 25px;
                margin: 30px 0;
            }

                .credentials h3 {
                    margin-bottom: 18px;
                    color: #534AB7;
                    font-size: 18px;
                }

            table {
                width: 100%;
                border-collapse: collapse;
            }

                table td {
                    padding: 14px 0;
                    border-bottom: 1px solid #ececec;
                    font-size: 15px;
                }

                table tr:last-child td {
                    border-bottom: none;
                }

                table td:first-child {
                    font-weight: 600;
                    color: #222;
                    width: 160px;
                }

            .password {
                font-family: Consolas, monospace;
                background: #ece8ff;
                color: #4d3fd3;
                padding: 5px 10px;
                border-radius: 6px;
                font-weight: bold;
            }

            .email {
                color: #534AB7;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            .button-area {
                text-align: center;
                margin: 35px 0;
            }

            .button {
                display: inline-block;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg,#534AB7,#6C63FF);
                color: #ffffff !important;
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 14px 36px;
                border-radius: 50px;
                font-weight: 600;
                font-size: 15px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(83,74,183,.3);
            }

            .note {
                background: #FFF8E7;
                border-left: 5px solid #F5B301;
                padding: 18px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                margin-top: 25px;
            }

                .note strong {
                    color: #8c6400;
                }

            .footer {
                text-align: center;
                background: #fafafa;
                padding: 30px;
                border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
            }

                .footer p {
                    color: #888;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                }

            @@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {

                .content {
                    padding: 25px;
                }

                .header {
                    padding: 35px 20px;
                }

                    .header h1 {
                        font-size: 28px;
                    }

                table td:first-child {
                    width: 120px;
                }
            }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎉 Welcome to ShopEase</h1>
            <p>Your account has been created successfully.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">

            <h2>Hello {{Name}},</h2>

            <p>
                Welcome to <strong>ShopEase</strong>! We're excited to have you with us.
                Your account is now ready, and you can sign in using the credentials below.
            </p>

            <div class="credentials">

                <h3>Account Information</h3>

                <table>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Email</td>
                        <td class="email">{{Email}}</td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td>Password</td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="password">{{Password}}</span>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>

            </div>

            <div class="button-area">
                <a href="{{LoginUrl}}" class="button">
                    Login to ShopEase →
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="note">
                <strong>Security Tip:</strong><br><br>
                Please change your temporary password immediately after your first login to keep your account secure.
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top:30px;">
                If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is always happy to help.
            </p>

            <p>
                Happy Shopping! ❤️<br>
                <strong>Team ShopEase</strong>
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>
                © 2026 ShopEase. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
            <p>
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>